  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (FULL). Read Provision-Customer.ps1's STEP 5 block in full (including its async-polling loop) plus PacAdminDataverseEnvCreator.cs's existing request-shape mapping.</step>
